,{\"candidateId\":\"evaluation:candidate:item-6585d2bdd49d\",\"contentIdentity\":\"content:sha256:fa5f1b5eaaf3d33cea82b7087910820794f10136a238a08c2508131a17e9596b\",\"sourceId\":\"open_web\",\"sourceName\":\"Open Web\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://example.test/resume/photo/item-6585d2bdd49d\",\"contentType\":\"article\",\"title\":\"风光滤镜：黄昏户外中的市场观察\",\"description\":\"风光滤镜：黄昏户外中的市场观察。汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益。 本文以黄昏户外为背景，按准备、观察、分析和复查四部分组织材料。案例只描述当前场景，不承诺适用于全部情况；读者需要核对自身条件再判断是否采用。\",\"contentSummary\":\"风光滤镜：黄昏户外中的市场观察。汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益。 本文以黄昏户外为背景，按准备、观察、分析和复查四部分组织材料。案例只描述当前场景，不承诺适用于全部情况；读者需要核对自身条件再判断是否采用。\",\"contentTruncated\":false,\"evidenceCompleteness\":\"full\",\"matchedInterestIds\":[\"evaluation:interest:photo\"],\"interestMatches\":[{\"interestId\":\"evaluation:interest:photo\",\"relevance\":\"direct\",\"matchReason\":\"Authored direct association with photo.\"}]}]</candidates>\n  <recent_recommendations>[]</recent_recommendations>\n</recommendation_material>","role":"user"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"Let me analyze this task carefully.\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct Candidates from the exposed working set (80 candidates), order them, and publish as one Recommendation collection.\n\nLet me understand the user's interest:\n- Interest: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focus on 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods), 成像原理 (imaging principles), 不同条件下的调整 (adjustments under different conditions). NOT interested in 器材促销 (equipment promotions) or 摄影师私生活 (photographers' private lives).\n\nLooking at candidates, each has a structure like:\n\"主题：场景中的类型\"\n\nWhere:\n- 主题 (topic): e.g., 静物布光, 运动追焦, 逆光人像, 雨天反光, 夜景曝光, 室内白平衡, 微距景深, 街头构图, 风光滤镜, 儿童抓拍\n- 场景 (scene): 低照度室内, 窗边自然光, 黄昏户外, 阴天街道\n- 类型 (type): \n  - 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - matches interest (成像原理, 变量作用, 适用条件)\n  - 操作记录 (operation records) - matches interest (实际拍摄方法)\n  - 概念速览 (concept overview) - matches interest (概念)\n  - 市场观察 (market observation) - does NOT match (器材促销, 明星代言, 购买套餐)\n  - 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, artists' biographies, historical backgrounds - partially matches? These are about 摄影展览策展线索、作者生平、作品流传 - essentially photographer's biography and exhibition viewing, which is closer to \"摄影师私生活\"? Hmm, not exactly private life but 作者生平 (author biography). The interest says not interested in 器材促销或摄影师私生活. The 专题观察 articles are about exhibition curation clues, artist life history, work circulation - that's more art-history/artist focus, not actual shooting methods or imaging principles. So probably not matching the interest.\n\nSo relevant candidates = those that are 条件与原理 (conditions/principles), 操作记录 (operation records), and possibly 概念速览 (concept overview) as these relate to learning methods. Actually, let me check the interest again: \"摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\"\n\nSo good content types:\n- 条件与原理: 从光线、成像与视觉关系解释画面差异，说明变量间的作用和方法的适用条件，并分析常见直觉在哪些条件下失效。→ This is directly on 成像原理 and 不同条件下的调整. Excellent match.\n- 操作记录: 先固定构图和光线，逐次改变拍摄参数并记录对应画面，比较高光、暗部与主体细节，再按画面差异调整设置。→ This is actual shooting methods / adjustments. Excellent match.\n- 概念速览: 列举常用概念... 为进一步阅读提供问题目录。→ It's a learning aid; moderately relevant (conceptual foundation for shooting methods). Probably acceptable. It says \"简要说明...中可能遇到的现象\" - describing phenomena in different conditions. Moderate match.\n\nBad content types:\n- 市场观察: 汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益。→ This is 器材促销 — explicit negative. Exclude.\n- 专题观察: 记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验。→ 作者生平 relates to 摄影师私生活/biography, exhibition viewing; not about actual shooting methods. Exclude. Well, \"作者生平与作品流传\" — this is not exactly \"摄影师私生活\" but it's about artist biography and historical context, not technique. Given the interest narrowly focuses on shooting methods/principles/adjustments and explicitly doesn't care about private lives (作者生平 is arguably more about work), I'll treat 专题观察 as low-relevance and exclude them.\n\nSo the working set of 80 candidates comprises: topic × scene × type with 5 types (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览, 市场观察, 专题观察). There are likely 10 topics, 4 scenes = 40 combos, × 5 types would be 200 but we have eligible 120 and working set 80. Let's count from what we see.\n\nTopics present: 静物布光, 运动追焦, 逆光人像, 雨天反光, 夜景曝光, 室内白平衡, 微距景深, 街头构图, 风光滤镜, 儿童抓拍. That's 10 topics.\n\nScenes: 低照度室内, 窗边自然光, 黄昏户外, 阴天街道. 4 scenes.\n\nSo 10 × 4 = 40 topic-scene combos. With 5 content types each would be 200 total. But eligibleCount=120, workingSetCount=80. The working set we see has candidates not fully uniform - e.g., 静物布光 appears in scenes 低照度室内, 阴天街道, 窗边自然光; some scenes missing. Let me not worry about total pool composition.\n\nNow, how many are relevant per the interest filter? I need to pick 20 candidates from relevant types. Let me count how many 条件与原理 and 操作记录 candidates exist in the 80.\n\nGiven interest emphasizes 实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整, top candidates are 条件与原理 and 操作记录. 概念速览 is basically an index/overview (列举概念 + 问题目录), could be okay but less substantive.\n\nLet me first count the candidates by type from the list of 80.\n\nI'll go through the candidate list:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d 静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察 → 市场观察 (exclude)\n2. item-03a565217024 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → 专题观察 (exclude)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n7. item-07bfbf16235d 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察 → exclude\n8. item-090691086c5b 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察 → exclude\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 微距景深：黄昏户外中的概念速览 → maybe include\n10. item-0a19145321ef 街头构图：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 微距景深：阴天街道中的市场观察 → exclude\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的概念速览 → maybe\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的操作记录 → INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 街头构图：黄昏户外中的专题观察 → exclude\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 街头构图：低照度室内中的专题观察 → exclude\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道中的操作记录 → INCLUDE\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的市场观察 → exclude\n